v0.13.2

New macvtap-cni release, focusing on CVEs.
No feature development happened since 0.13.1

Bugs:
* fix: use ls instead of test -S in DaemonSet probes
* build(deps): bump google.golang.org/grpc from 1.56.3 to 1.79.3
* fix: use full three-part Go version in go.mod
* fix: replace gimme with direct Go download in CI setup
* bump: golang 1.20 -> 1.25
* fix: align CNI temp iface naming
* fix: temporary interface name (before moving into pod) is generated from a hash to ensure it's always short enough to fit into a linux interface name

```
docker pull quay.io/kubevirt/macvtap-cni:v0.13.2
```
